   "fadeOut": 0.35,
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 1.4,
   "text": "PYTHON. IN A HORROR GAME.",
   "y": -420,
   "fontSize": 54
  },
  {
   "text": "This horror demo shipped\nwith Python inside it. And\na machine learning\nruntime.",
   "start": 0.0,
   "duration": 5.009,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "In a game about noticing\nwhen something has\nchanged.",
   "start": 5.259,
   "duration": 3.337,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "It's COMPARTMENT 666. You\nwake on a 1900s express.",
   "start": 10.846,
   "duration": 4.251,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Walk into a carriage and\ndecide: normal, or not.",
   "start": 15.347,
   "duration": 3.128,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Get it wrong and you lose\na life. You get three. The\nExit 8 loop, plus a radio.",
   "start": 18.725,
   "duration": 5.192,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Thirty six files, Unreal.\nThe binary is still called\nUnrealGame. Nobody renamed\nit.",
   "start": 24.167,
   "duration": 6.576,
   "fontSize": 42,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  },
  {
   "text": "Beside it: the DirectX 12\ndebug layer, boost python,\nDirectML and ONNX.",
   "start": 30.993,
   "duration": 5.557,
   "fontSize": 50,
   "y": 560,
   "bgOpacity": 0.62
  }
